---

<Base
  title="For hotels and brands — Verseworks"
  description="Give every guest something that did not exist before they arrived. Live, multilingual poetry activations for hotels, hospitality spaces, brands and private events."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[68rem] px-6 pt-[10vh] pb-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-hero max-w-4xl text-ink">
      Give every guest something that did not exist before they arrived.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-8 max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      Verseworks creates live, multilingual poetry activations for hotels,
      hospitality spaces, brands and private events. Each experience is
      personal enough to feel intimate and beautifully produced enough to
      belong within the wider identity of the host.
    </p>
    <a href="/enquire" class="btn mt-10">Create an experience</a>
  </section>
</Base>
